\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\lang1033 Key Features: Data integration, retrieval, indexing, orchestration, scalability, and enterprise AI support.\par
\b LangChain Overview\lang16393\~\par
\b0\lang1033 LangChain is an open-source framework designed to simplify the creation of applications powered by Large Language Models. It provides modular components such as prompts, chains, agents, tools, memory, retrievers, and output parsers. LangChain allows developers to connect AI models with databases, APIs, search engines, and external applications.\lang16393\~\line\~\line\lang1033 Core Components:\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Prompts\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Chains\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Agents\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Memory\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Tools\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Output Parsers\lang16393\~\line\~\line\lang1033 Advantages: Rapid development, model independence, large ecosystem, extensive integrations.\lang16393\~\line\~\line\lang1033 Limitations: Increased complexity in large projects and higher debugging effort.\lang16393\~\par
\lang1033 LangChain is an open-source framework designed to simplify the creation of applications powered by Large Language Models. It provides modular components such as prompts, chains, agents, tools, memory, retrievers, and output parsers. LangChain allows developers to connect AI models with databases, APIs, search engines, and external applications.\lang16393\~\line\~\line\lang1033 Core Components:\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Prompts\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Chains\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Agents\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Memory\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Tools\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Output Parsers\lang16393\~\line\~\line\lang1033 Advantages: Rapid development, model independence, large ecosystem, extensive integrations.\lang16393\~\line\~\line\lang1033 Limitations: Increased complexity in large projects and higher debugging effort.\lang16393\~\par
\b\lang1033 LangChain Architecture\lang16393\~\par
\b0\lang1033 The architecture consists of prompt engineering, LLM processing, memory management, tool integration, and agent execution. Agents can dynamically decide which tools to use based on a user query.\lang16393\~\par
\lang1033 The architecture consists of prompt engineering, LLM processing, memory management, tool integration, and agent execution. Agents can dynamically decide which tools to use based on a user query.\par
\b LlamaIndex\lang16393\~\par
\b0\lang1033 LlamaIndex is a data framework for connecting private and enterprise data with large language models. It specializes in indexing, retrieval, and building Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) applications.\lang16393\~\par

