\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b\lang1033 LlamaIndex Overview\lang16393\~\par
\b0\lang1033 LlamaIndex is a data framework that enables LLMs to access and understand enterprise data. It specializes in ingestion, indexing, retrieval, and querying. LlamaIndex is frequently used with vector databases to implement RAG systems.\lang16393\~\line\~\line\lang1033 Key Features:\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Data connectors\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Index creation\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Query engine\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Retrieval engine\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Vector database integration\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Structured and unstructured data support\lang16393\~\par
\lang1033 LlamaIndex is a data framework that enables LLMs to access and understand enterprise data. It specializes in ingestion, indexing, retrieval, and querying. LlamaIndex is frequently used with vector databases to implement RAG systems.\lang16393\~\line\~\line\lang1033 Key Features:\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Data connectors\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Index creation\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Query engine\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Retrieval engine\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Vector database integration\lang16393\~\line\lang1033\bullet  Structured and unstructured data support\lang16393\~\par
\b\fs28\lang1033 LlamaIndex Workflow\lang16393\~\fs24\par
\b0\lang1033 The workflow begins by collecting information from PDFs, websites, databases, and cloud storage. The data is transformed into embeddings and stored in vector databases such as Pinecone, Chroma, Weaviate, or Milvus. When a user submits a query, relevant data is retrieved and provided to the LLM for generating an accurate response.\lang16393\~\par
\lang1033 The workflow begins by collecting information from PDFs, websites, databases, and cloud storage. The data is transformed into embeddings and stored in vector databases such as Pinecone, Chroma, Weaviate, or Milvus. When a user submits a query, relevant data is retrieved and provided to the LLM for generating an accurate response.\lang16393\~\par
\par
\b\fs28\lang1033 Haystack\fs24\lang16393\~\par
\b0\lang1033 Haystack is an open-source AI orchestration framework focused on search, question answering, and RAG pipelines. It supports document stores, retrievers, generators, and end-to-end AI pipelines.\lang16393\par
