\b Haystack Overview\lang16393\~\par
\b0\lang1033 Haystack is an AI orchestration framework focused on search and Retrieval-Augmented Generation. It provides pipelines, document stores, retrievers, generators, and evaluators. Haystack supports modern LLMs and can build production-grade conversational AI systems.\lang16393\~\par
