\b Haystack Architecture\lang16393\~\par
\b0\lang1033 A typical Haystack pipeline consists of document ingestion, indexing, retrieval, reranking, generation, and evaluation. This pipeline-based design offers high flexibility and scalability.\lang16393\~\par
